        "gJhqRigAXAlYz_text": "<p>Wellness Nest's Shilajit Essential Extract stands out for its exceptional potency, boasting a remarkable <strong>30:1 concentration</strong>, delivering 30g of extract equivalent to 900g of raw Shilajit. Sourced from pristine Himalayan regions in India, it undergoes rigorous third-party testing to guarantee the highest quality and purity, with a <strong>fulvic acid</strong> content <strong>exceeding</strong> <strong>78%</strong>. This naturally derived resin is free from any artificial additives or fillers, ensuring you experience the true benefits of this ancient and revered substance</p>",
        "gOkjeCxaRPAXt_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:35px;\"><strong>1: Shilajit Essential Extract&nbsp;</strong></span><br>by Wellness Nest</p>",
